    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu Wuu Daryeeli Doonaa Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xilliga roobka dambe roob ka barya Rabbiga, isagoo ah Rabbiga hillaaca sameeya, oo iyaguu siin doonaa roob wanaagsan, oo wuxuu qof kasta beerta ku siin doonaa doog. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, teraafiimkii waxay ku hadleen wax aan waxba ahayn, waxsheegayaashiina wax been ah bay arkeen, oo waxay sheegeen riyooyin been ah, oo si aan waxtar lahayn ayay ugu qalbi qaboojiyaan, haddaba sidaas daraaddeed waxay u ambadaan sida ido oo kale, oo aad bay u dhibtoodaan, maxaa yeelay, adhijir ma leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adhijirrada aad baan ugu cadhooday, oo waxaan ciqaabi doonaa orgida, waayo, Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu soo booqday idihiisii ahaa dadka dalka Yahuudah, oo wuxuu ka dhigi doonaa sida faraskiisa sharafta leh oo dagaalka ku jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa isaga ka iman doona dhagaxa rukunka, oo dhidibkuna isaguu ka iman doonaa, qaansada dagaalkuna isagay ka iman doontaa, oo taliye kastaana isaguu ka iman doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana waxay ahaan doonaan sida rag xoog badan oo dagaal gala oo cadowgooda kula tunta dhoobada jidadka dhex taal. Wayna diriri doonaan, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiga ayaa iyaga la jira. Oo kuwa fardaha ku joogaana way isku qasmi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Yahuudah waan xoogayn doonaa, waanan badbaadin doonaa reer Yuusuf, oo mar kalaan soo celin doonaa, waayo, waan u naxariisanayaa, oo waxay noqon doonaan sidii iyagoo aanan xoorin, waayo, waxaan ahay Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah, oo waan maqli doonaa iyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa reer Efrayimna waxay noqon doonaan sida nin xoog badan, oo qalbigooduna wuxuu u rayrayn doonaa sidii iyagoo khamri ka wabxay, oo carruurtooduna way arki doonaan, oo way rayrayn doonaan, oo qalbigooduna waa ku farxi doonaa Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigu waan u foodhyi doonaa iyaga, oo waan isu soo wada ururin doonaa, waayo, waan soo furtay, oo waxay u badan doonaan siday u badnaan jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan iyaga ku beeri doonaa dadyowga dhexdooda, wayna igu soo xusuusan doonaan waddammo fog. Way noolaan doonaan iyaga iyo carruurtooda, oo way soo noqon doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mar kalaan ka soo bixin doonaa dalkii Masar, Ashuurna waan ka soo ururin doonaa, oo waxaan iyaga keeni doonaa dalka Gilecaad iyo Lubnaan, oo weliba meel looma heli doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu wuxuu dhex mari doonaa badda dhibaatada, oo wax buu ku dhufan doonaa hirarka badda, oo Webi Niil moolkiisuna waa engegi doonaa, oo kibirka Ashuurna waa la soo dejin doonaa, oo usha boqortooyada Masarna way iska baabbi'i doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagaan ku xoogayn doonaa Rabbiga, oo hor iyo dibba way ugu socon doonaan magiciisa, ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
